'''''Bunias''''' is a genus of [[flowering plant]]s in the cabbage family [[Brassicaceae]]. The genus includes three  accepted species which range from the Mediterranean region to central and Eastern Europe, Western Asia, Siberia, and northern China.<ref name = powo/>
*''[[Bunias cochlearioides]]'' {{small|Murray}}
*''[[Bunias erucago]]'' {{small|L.}} – crested warty cabbage, corn rocket<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Blažević |first1=Ivica |last2=Đulović |first2=Azra |last3=Čikeš Čulić |first3=Vedrana |last4=Burčul |first4=Franko |last5=Ljubenkov |first5=Ivica |last6=Ruščić |first6=Mirko |last7=Generalić Mekinić |first7=Ivana |date=January 2019 |title=Bunias erucago L.: Glucosinolate Profile and In Vitro Biological Potential |journal=Molecules |language=en |volume=24 |issue=4 |pages=741 |doi=10.3390/molecules24040741 |issn=1420-3049 |pmc=6412829 |pmid=30791395|doi-access=free }}</ref>
* ''[[Bunias orientalis]]'' {{small|L.}} – Turkish rocket, hill mustard, Turkish warty cabbage, warty cabbage<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Dietz |first1=Hansjörg |last2=Steinlein |first2=Thomas |last3=Ullmann |first3=Isolde |date=1999-11-01 |title=Establishment of the invasive perennial herb Bunias orientalis L.: An experimental approach |url=https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1146609X99001046 |journal=Acta Oecologica |language=en |volume=20 |issue=6 |pages=621–632 |doi=10.1016/S1146-609X(99)00104-6 |bibcode=1999AcO....20..621D |issn=1146-609X|url-access=subscription }}</ref>

